origin observed 2026-11-28 docs/observed/bcm2712-topology.md at commit eab4162; constraints read from hvs-backend-design.md
# Hand-written topology, not produced by the converter. No hardware claim.
# Source: docs/observed/bcm2712-topology.md (probe output observed 2026-11-28), repository commit eab4162.
# Constraint lines are read from docs/hvs-backend-design.md; nothing was run for this file.
# No frames in this file.
# Planes are the 16 of probe's cut view (MAX_PLANES = 16), not the kernel's 56 (4 primaries, first 12 overlays by id).
# Output: the one connected CRTC (HDMI, 1920x1080). Masks as recorded: 0x1 reaches it, 0x0 other CRTCs.
profile generic
output 94 1920 1080 60000
# Cursor planes: the recorded probe view lists none (hvs-backend-design.md section 3: the extra
# per-CRTC planes were not typed). If one is added later keep it here; cross-check v1 does not
# exercise cursor planes (design section 4).
# transforms: rotate-0/180 and reflect-x/y, no 90/270 (hvs-backend-design.md section 3, tag source;
# observed 2026-11-28 on BCM2712). Not read from this dump if it records no rotation mask.
# scaling=none on every plane: KMS has no scaling property and the design states no values
# (sections 3 and 5, open question 1 in section 7); not invented here.
# max_source=none: HVS6 has no source-width check in the source (hvs-backend-design.md sections 3 and 5, tag source).
# full_output=0: neither the design nor the dump states a full-output requirement.
# No group lines: the design names LBM/UPM limits (sections 3 and 4) but gives no capacity to adopt;
# check (TEST_ONLY) stays authoritative there.
# zpos_now: plane 107 = 1 is the value recorded in the dump (per-plane properties); the dump records none for the
# other planes listed, so they carry their 0-based index in this file's plane order (5..15).
# formats: the 32 pairs as probe printed them (first 32 linear formats of IN_FORMATS, MAX_FORMATS cut), in dump order.
# probe prints no modifiers, so 0x0 (linear) is the linear group; the Broadcom modifiers of the blob are not in this view.
